    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Adventurer's Atlas improves.</p><p><strong>Safe Haven.</strong> When a map holder would be reduced to 0 Hit Points but not killed outright, it can destroy its map: its Hit Points instead change to twice your Artificer level, and it teleports to an unoccupied space within 5 feet of you or of another map holder of its choice.</p><p><strong>Unerring Path.</strong> If you are one of the map holders, you can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFindthePat]{Find the Path} without expending a spell slot, preparing it, or components. Once you use this benefit, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
